                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15fe911c-d0e2-3abf-812e-f4e9dd7a2856",
                        "entry_id": "f81ff425-f091-3ca8-b0f3-c21b69718203",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. медицинский инструмент в виде цилиндра с поршнем и полой иглой для введения (впрыскивания) лекарства под кожу, в мышцы, вены и т. п. или для отсасывания жидкого содержимого из полостей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d20ba8b-f856-4765-a773-830f342376b5",
                                "sense_id": "15fe911c-d0e2-3abf-812e-f4e9dd7a2856",
                                "text": "Доктор вздохнул, пожал плечами и вынул из аптечного шкафа футляр с правацовским шприцем."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0782c9e6-0deb-475d-9c6c-ad6d04da092a",
                                "sense_id": "15fe911c-d0e2-3abf-812e-f4e9dd7a2856",
                                "text": "Борменталь с хрустом сломал стеклянную ампулку, насосал из неё шприц и коварно кольнул Шарика где-то у сердца."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3aece90d-9f9b-4451-85e4-3f32df80f029",
                        "source_entry_id": "f81ff425-f091-3ca8-b0f3-c21b69718203",
                        "source_sense_id": "15fe911c-d0e2-3abf-812e-f4e9dd7a2856",
                        "target_lang_word": "syringe",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "syringe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17b12acc-5f6c-349e-b5b5-c465681b959e",
                                        "entry_id": "b2341f4c-c256-3d71-9ba5-429800458d7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device used for injecting or drawing fluids through a membrane."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ef38720-8334-4a34-8105-346938f3caa4",
                                                "sense_id": "17b12acc-5f6c-349e-b5b5-c465681b959e",
                                                "text": "In Kelly’s case, once the baby was admitted to the hospital, she began to use formula, fed through a syringe—she was told to avoid bottles because the baby would reject the breast."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6f9e62e-5ba9-35c0-932a-29c538f45c35",
                                        "entry_id": "b2341f4c-c256-3d71-9ba5-429800458d7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device consisting of a hypodermic needle, a chamber for containing liquids, and a piston for applying pressure (to inject) or reducing pressure (to draw); a hypodermic syringe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "syringe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0998bcb-e0ea-37f1-9654-2677d856e5bb",
                                        "entry_id": "c932df7d-9d0c-31b9-a2ab-c0899db591f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To clean or rinse by means of a syringe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bc8f7cb-bf5c-4cc2-8230-a112f1258469",
                                                "sense_id": "f0998bcb-e0ea-37f1-9654-2677d856e5bb",
                                                "text": "Have your ears syringed! They're so dirty!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bc1c97b-713e-3bb0-a421-0bd00b4bd6b5",
                                        "entry_id": "c932df7d-9d0c-31b9-a2ab-c0899db591f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To inject by means of a syringe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
